     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">You can dynamically build a tabsetPanel using do.call (e.g. do.call(tabsetPanel, listOfTabPanels)). But that doesn&#39;t help with the problem of dynamically adding new tabs to an existing tabset.<div><br></div><div>It&#39;s kind of embarrassing that this isn&#39;t in Shiny base, but it&#39;s not (unless I am forgetting something we did recently--but I don&#39;t think I am).</div><div><br></div><div>These Stack Overflow threads may help you:</div><div><a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/19470426/r-shiny-add-tabpanel-to-tabsetpanel-dynamicaly-with-the-use-of-renderui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/19470426/r-shiny-add-tabpanel-to-tabsetpanel-dynamicaly-with-the-use-of-renderui&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792390283968000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Fe5PqiRvZdWu_yZgVvxD3\">http://stackoverflow.com/questions/19470426/r-shiny-add-tabpanel-to-tabsetpanel-dynamicaly-with-the-use-of-renderui</a><br></div><div><a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/35020810/dynamically-creating-tabs-with-plots-in-shiny-without-re-creating-existing-tabs/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/35020810/dynamically-creating-tabs-with-plots-in-shiny-without-re-creating-existing-tabs/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792390283968000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0NHrjDeO1FBP3m97vNlHt_\">http://stackoverflow.com/questions/35020810/dynamically-creating-tabs-with-plots-in-shiny-without-re-creating-existing-tabs/</a><br></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
